    # Data product / Snapshot
    producer: Centers for Disease Control and Prevention
    title: National Notifiable Diseases Surveillance System (NNDSS) Annual Summary Data
    description: |-
      Finalized annual counts of reported measles cases in the United States, by year and reporting area (US regions, states, New York City and US territories). Cases are split into indigenous cases (infected in the United States) and imported cases (infected outside the United States), and a total. New York State figures exclude New York City, which reports separately.
    date_published: "2025"
    # Citation
    citation_full: |-
      Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. National Notifiable Diseases Surveillance System (NNDSS) Annual Summary Data for years 2016-2023, United States, CDC WONDER online database.
    attribution_short: CDC
    # Files
